<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - True North said upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - True North said upped.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette raised its  rating on True North Communications Inc to buy from market perform,  according to a market source.</p>
<p>The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>True North, an advertising company, said Thursday it signed a definitive  agreement to acquire Bozell, Jacobs, Kenyon and Eckhardt Inc in a  transaction valued at about $440 million.</p>
<p>-- shares opened up 1/8 to 25.</p>
</text>
